      48.0,
      450.51,
      542.53,
      523.98
    ],
    "text": "I, Sunil Kumara Gamage, Minister of Youth Affairs and Sports, by virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 39 of the Sports Law, No. 25 of 1973 and its amendments hereby direct the WORKING TASK FORCE appointed by the Extraor-dinary Gazette Notification bearing No. 2437/32 published on 22nd of May, 2025 to adopt the Constitution of Sri Lanka Rugby as recommended by the Constitutional Review Group appointed by the World Rugby, and agreed upon by all the stakeholders, and which was published along with the notice issued by the Director General of Sports ( Competent Author-ity) of Sri Lanka Rugby bearing No. DSD/NSA/COM/01/2024, dated 24.06.2024.",
